                ],
                [
                    418.0,
                    262.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees shall be granted a leave of absence with pay in accordance with the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                174,
                287,
                1056,
                313
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    174.0,
                    287.0
                ],
                [
                    1056.0,
                    287.0
                ],
                [
                    1056.0,
                    313.0
                ],
                [
                    174.0,
                    313.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Service with a jury. The employee may keep any money paid by the court for serving on jury.",
            "block_bbox": [
                174,
                315,
                1115,
                362
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    174.0,
                    315.0
                ],
                [
                    1115.0,
                    315.0
                ],
                [
                    1115.0,
                    362.0
                ],
                [
                    174.0,
                    362.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Appearances before a court, legislative committee, or judicial body as a witness in response to a subpoena or other direction by proper authority for matters relating to the employee's officially assigned duties. The employee may keep any money paid in connection with the appearance.",
            "block_bbox": [
                174,
                364,
                1117,
                462
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    174.0,
                    364.0
                ],
                [
                    1117.0,
                    364.0
                ],
                [
                    1117.0,
                    462.0
                ],
                [
                    174.0,
                    462.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Taking part without pay in a search and rescue operation at the specific request of any law enforcement agency, the Administrator of the Board of Aeronautics, the United States Forest Service, or any local organization of civil defense, for a period of no more than five (5) working days.",
            "block_bbox": [
                174,
                465,
                1118,
                563
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    174.0,
                    465.0
                ],
                [
                    1118.0,
                    465.0
                ],
                [
                    1118.0,
                    563.0
                ],
                [
                    174.0,
                    563.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. Other authorized duties in connection with State business.",
            "block_bbox": [
                176,
                565,
                820,
                590
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    176.0,
                    565.0
                ],
                [
                    820.0,
                    565.0
                ],
                [
                    820.0,
                    590.0
                ],
                [
                    176.0,
                    590.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. An employee who has been employed in State service for six (6) months or more, and who is a member of the National Guard or any reserve components of the armed forces of the United States, is entitled to leave of absence from the employee's duties for a period not to exceed fifteen (15) calendar days or eleven (11) working days in any federal fiscal year (October through September).",
            "block_bbox": [
                175,
                590,
                1118,
                715
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    175.0,
                    590.0
                ],
                [
                    1118.0,
                    590.0
                ],
                [
                    1118.0,
                    715.0
                ],
                [
                    175.0,
                    715.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "f. An employee may be granted educational leave in which the Agency may defray a part or all of the cost, either through allotment or payment of salary. Such leave shall be granted only when the benefits to be realized by the State will outweigh the cost and inconvenience to the State. Each request for leave must be approved by the Agency Head or designee, who normally shall not approve such leave for more than one (1) year. Vacation leave shall not accrue during an educational leave with pay, the duration of which exceeds fifteen (15) calendar days.",
            "block_bbox": [
                172,
                717,
                1117,
                891
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    172.0,
