                    172.0,
                    891.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "g. Leave with pay for job interviewing and testing for employment opportunities in state government may be arranged by the Appointing Authority, who will determine the amount of time that is appropriate.",
